{"type":"npc","name":"Shadowblooded","folder":null,"system":{"attributes":{"hp":{"value":350,"temp":0,"max":350,"details":"dualistic nature"},"ac":{"value":43,"details":""},"allSaves":{"value":""},"speed":{"value":40,"otherSpeeds":[{"type":"fly","value":80}],"details":""},"immunities":[{"type":"bleed","exceptions":[]},{"type":"blinded","exceptions":[]},{"type":"dazzled","exceptions":[]},{"type":"death-effects","exceptions":[]},{"type":"disease","exceptions":[]},{"type":"paralyzed","exceptions":[]},{"type":"poison","exceptions":[]},{"type":"sleep","exceptions":[]}]},"initiative":{"statistic":"perception"},"details":{"languages":{"value":["common","diabolic","draconic","empyrean","necril"],"details":"Truespeech"},"level":{"value":19},"blurb":"","publicNotes":"<p>Shadowblooded are vampiric fallen angels that change their nature depending on whether they are in darkness, shadow, or light. Their dual nature makes them a dangerous and unpredictable foe.</p><h2>Vampiric Angels</h2><p>Shadowblooded are a rare variety of fallen angels who develop vampiric powers. They can only be born from angels who willingly undertake or are otherwise exposed to rituals to transform into undead but who have too much innate spiritual power to be completely remade. Thus, shadowblooded are neither fully holy nor fully unholy. They are often most comfortable in the shadows, both physically and metaphorically. However, their dual nature makes them volatile, as they can engage in both acts of great mercy and benevolence, as well as deeds of utter depravity.</p><h2>Suggested Monster Parts</h2><p><strong>Monster Parts</strong> 5,000/12,000/22,500 gp</p><p><strong>Eligible Refinements</strong> weapons (piercing, slashing), perception item, skill items (Acrobatics, Deception, Intimidation, Religion, Stealth)</p><p><strong>Eligible Imbued Properties</strong> bane, charisma, death, darkness, dexterity, energy resistant (void), life, lifeward armor, light, sensory (darkvision, greater darkvision), space, space shield, throwing, wild, winged, wisdom</p>","privateNotes":"","publication":{"title":"Battlezoo Bestiary: Elemental Storm (Pathfinder)","authors":"Gary Polley J","license":"ORC","remaster":true}},"resources":{},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":0.941,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"abilities":{"str":{"mod":6},"dex":{"mod":10},"con":{"mod":6},"int":{"mod":6},"wis":{"mod":8},"cha":{"mod":10}},"perception":{"details":"","mod":37,"senses":[{"type":"greater-darkvision"},{"type":"lifesense","acuity":"precise","range":60}],"vision":true},"saves":{"fortitude":{"value":29,"saveDetail":""},"reflex":{"value":35,"saveDetail":""},"will":{"value":33,"saveDetail":""}},"skills":{"acrobatics":{"base":37},"deception":{"base":35},"intimidation":{"base":37},"religion":{"base":35},"stealth":{"base":35}},"traits":{"value":["angel","celestial","undead"],"rarity":"rare","size":{"value":"med"}}},"_id":"vtgjgsv0aWUBGysN","img":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e/assets/portraits/shadowblooded.webp","prototypeToken":{"name":"Shadowblooded","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false,"width":1,"height":1,"texture":{"src":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e/assets/tokens/shadowblooded.webp","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"offsetX":0,"offsetY":0,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"rotation":0,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"attributes.hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":null},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":[],"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":true,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e/assets/subjects/shadowblooded.webp"}},"flags":{"pf2e":{"linkToActorSize":true,"autoscale":false}},"randomImg":false,"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null},"items":[{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Constant Spells","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"interaction","description":{"value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.ConstantSpells]</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Monster Core","authors":""},"rules":[],"traits":{"value":[],"otherTags":[]},"slug":"constant-spells","_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.kakyXBG5WA8c6Zfd","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"HwJeWR71OFzutXBe"},{"name":"Divine Innate Spells","type":"spellcastingEntry","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"ability":{"value":"cha"},"spelldc":{"value":37,"dc":45},"tradition":{"value":"divine"},"prepared":{"value":"innate"},"showSlotlessLevels":{"value":false},"proficiency":{"value":1},"slots":{"slot0":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot1":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot2":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot3":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot4":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot5":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot6":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot7":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot8":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot9":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot10":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot11":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0}},"autoHeightenLevel":{"value":null}},"_id":"WqI63591wtU1raAM","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/spellcastingEntry.svg","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"folder":"zDlxATrLAlbYA2Mv","img":"icons/magic/holy/barrier-shield-winged-blue.webp","name":"Blessed Boundary (In Bright Light Only)","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>Manifestations of divine force appear in the hundreds, swirling in a massive, protective sphere. These typically look like spiky fragments, but often take on an appearance themed to the deity of the caster. The sphere is hollow, with the manifestations forming a shell 2 inches deep on the outer edge. You can choose to make the burst smaller, in 5-foot increments, when you cast it. The shell provides cover and can intersect solid terrain without affecting it. The shell deals 7d8 force damage to each creature who intersects with the shell when the sphere's created, or who attempts to move through the shell. The creature also takes the damage at the end of its turn, but only if it didn't already take damage from the shell that turn. The effects are determined by a creature's Reflex save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature takes half damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature takes full damage, is pushed up to 10 feet in the direction of your choice, and ends its movement.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature takes double damage, is pushed up to 20 feet in the direction of your choice, and ends its movement.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d8.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"blessed-boundary","_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","force","manipulate","sanctified"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["divine"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":6},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":"120 feet"},"area":{"type":"burst","value":60},"time":{"value":"3"},"duration":{"value":"1 minute","sustained":false},"damage":{"rQT6Is4xVcbWJIAt":{"applyMod":false,"category":null,"formula":"7d8","kinds":["damage"],"materials":[],"type":"force"}},"defense":{"save":{"basic":true,"statistic":"reflex"}},"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"WqI63591wtU1raAM","heightenedLevel":9},"counteraction":false,"heightening":{"area":0,"damage":{"rQT6Is4xVcbWJIAt":"1d8"},"interval":1,"type":"interval"}},"type":"spell","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.jj5d830iUi2ZlQfs","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"Cox4mFPo3dBsNEAJ"},{"folder":"xqlqJ6eeiNtWb7bq","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/eclipse-burst.webp","name":"Eclipse Burst (In Darkness Only)","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>A globe of freezing darkness explodes in the area, dealing 8d10 cold damage to creatures in the area, plus an additional 8d4 void damage to living creatures. Each creature in the area must attempt a Reflex save.</p>\n<p>If the globe overlaps with an area of magical light or affects a creature affected by magical light, eclipse burst attempts to counteract the light effect.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature takes half damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature takes full damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature takes double damage and becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.XgEqL1kFApUbl5Z2]{Blinded} by the darkness for an unlimited duration.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The cold damage increases by 1d10 and the void damage against the living increases by 1d4.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"eclipse-burst","_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["cold","concentrate","darkness","manipulate","void"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","divine","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":7},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":"500 feet"},"area":{"type":"burst","value":60},"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":false},"damage":{"0":{"applyMod":false,"category":null,"formula":"8d10","kinds":["damage"],"materials":[],"type":"cold"},"v1pnjhfu6e9akqe0":{"applyMod":false,"category":null,"formula":"8d4","kinds":["damage"],"materials":[],"type":"void"}},"defense":{"save":{"basic":true,"statistic":"reflex"}},"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"WqI63591wtU1raAM","heightenedLevel":9},"counteraction":false,"heightening":{"area":0,"damage":{"0":"1d10","v1pnjhfu6e9akqe0":"1d4"},"interval":1,"type":"interval"}},"type":"spell","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.0jadeyQIItIuRgeH","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"ReOjpsMBCS7p2eMa"},{"folder":"fi1AYNmuCRvoT15b","img":"icons/magic/control/control-influence-crown-gold.webp","name":"Overwhelming Presence","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You surround yourself with supernatural splendor, appearing to be a god or similarly majestic being, with an appearance, regalia, and iconography of your choice. Targets must attempt a Will save. Regardless of the outcome, the target is then temporarily immune for 1 minute.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target must pay tribute to you two times. Paying tribute requires that the target spend a single action, which has either the move trait (as they bow) or manipulate trait (as they offer up a token in their hands). They must pay tribute at least once on each of their turns, if possible. While affected, the target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AdPVz7rbaVSRxHFg]{Fascinated} by you and can't use hostile actions against you.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> As success, but the target must pay tribute a total of six times.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but the target must spend all its actions paying tribute, and they cannot take other actions until the tribute is fully paid.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"overwhelming-presence","_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["auditory","concentrate","incapacitation","manipulate","mental","visual"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["divine","occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":9},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"any number of creatures"},"range":{"value":""},"area":{"type":"burst","value":40},"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"until full tribute is paid","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":{"save":{"basic":false,"statistic":"will"}},"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"WqI63591wtU1raAM","heightenedLevel":9},"counteraction":false},"type":"spell","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.fkDeKktdmbeplYRY","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"zyVWZzdnCFBipzs5"},{"folder":"xqlqJ6eeiNtWb7bq","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/sunburst.webp","name":"Sunburst (In Bright Light Only)","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>A powerful globe of searing sunlight explodes in the area, dealing 8d10 fire damage to all creatures in the area, plus an additional @Damage[(@item.level+1)d10[vitality]] damage to undead creatures. Each creature in the area must attempt a Reflex save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature takes half damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature takes full damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature takes full damage and becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.XgEqL1kFApUbl5Z2]{Blinded} permanently.</p>\n<p>If the globe overlaps with an area of magical darkness, <em>sunburst</em> attempts to counteract the darkness effect.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The fire damage increases by 1d10, and the vitality damage against undead increases by 1d10.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"sunburst","_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","fire","light","manipulate","vitality"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["divine","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":7},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":"500 feet"},"area":{"type":"burst","value":60},"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":false},"damage":{"0":{"applyMod":false,"category":null,"formula":"8d10","kinds":["damage"],"materials":[],"type":"fire"}},"defense":{"save":{"basic":false,"statistic":"reflex"}},"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"WqI63591wtU1raAM","heightenedLevel":9},"counteraction":true,"heightening":{"area":0,"damage":{"0":"1d10"},"interval":1,"type":"interval"}},"type":"spell","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.a3aQxCpoj1q1NQxC","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"qKrvXdLoQz42177Y"},{"folder":"fi1AYNmuCRvoT15b","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/fatal-aria.webp","name":"Wails of the Damned (In Darkness Only)","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You howl a lament of damned souls. Each living enemy in the area takes 8d10 void damage and must attempt a Fortitude save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature takes full damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature takes full damage and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drained} [[/r 1d4]].</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature takes double damage and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drained 4}.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"wails-of-the-damned","_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["auditory","concentrate","death","manipulate","void"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["divine","occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":9},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":""},"area":{"type":"emanation","value":40},"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":false},"damage":{"0":{"applyMod":false,"category":null,"formula":"8d10","kinds":["damage"],"materials":[],"type":"void"}},"defense":{"save":{"basic":false,"statistic":"fortitude"}},"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"WqI63591wtU1raAM","heightenedLevel":9},"counteraction":false},"type":"spell","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.FEsuyf203wTNE2et","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"iiiz2bNNp1RIJ6g8"},{"folder":"IfuYSF4ymX48CZnm","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/canticle-of-everlasting-grief.webp","name":"Canticle of Everlasting Grief","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You create a melody distilled from pure grief, conveying the inevitable loss of everything your target cherishes, audible to only them. The target takes 10d6 mental damage depending on its Will save. A creature cursed by this spell can't benefit from circumstance or status bonuses, for the duration noted in the degree of success.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target takes half damage, is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 1}, and is cursed for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target takes full damage, is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 3}, and is cursed for 1 week.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target takes double damage, is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 4}, and is cursed for an unlimited duration. While the curse remains, the target's allies are also affected by the curse while within 15 feet of the creature.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"canticle-of-everlasting-grief","_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["auditory","concentrate","curse","emotion","fear","manipulate","mental"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["divine","occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":8},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"range":{"value":"120 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"varies","sustained":false},"damage":{"XBFtljOdUx24bHoA":{"applyMod":false,"category":null,"formula":"10d6","kinds":["damage"],"materials":[],"type":"mental"}},"defense":{"save":{"basic":true,"statistic":"will"}},"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"WqI63591wtU1raAM","heightenedLevel":8},"counteraction":false},"type":"spell","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.qlxM7Ik3uUeUIOcv","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"uR4KWZbb58CYLoZy"},{"folder":"zDlxATrLAlbYA2Mv","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/spiritual-blast.webp","name":"Spirit Blast","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You concentrate ethereal energy and attack a creature's spirit, dealing 16d6 spirit damage with a basic Fortitude save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 2d6.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"spirit-blast","_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","manipulate","spirit"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["divine","occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":6},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"range":{"value":"30 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":false},"damage":{"0":{"applyMod":false,"category":null,"formula":"16d6","kinds":["damage"],"materials":[],"type":"spirit"}},"defense":{"save":{"basic":true,"statistic":"fortitude"}},"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"WqI63591wtU1raAM","heightenedLevel":8},"counteraction":false,"heightening":{"damage":{"0":"2d6"},"interval":1,"type":"interval"}},"type":"spell","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.PHVHBbdHeQRfjLmE","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"8UAx1WIitIwZ2noG"},{"folder":"iDjm2cXyRAe4VZ35","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/tongues.webp","name":"Truespeech","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The target can understand all words regardless of language and also speak the languages of other creatures. When in a mixed group of creatures, each time the target speaks, it can choose a creature and speak in a language that creature understands, even if the target doesn't know what language that is.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (7th)</strong> The duration is 8 hours.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"truespeech","_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","manipulate"],"rarity":"uncommon","traditions":["arcane","divine","occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":5},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"range":{"value":"touch"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"1 hour","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"WqI63591wtU1raAM","heightenedLevel":5},"counteraction":false},"type":"spell","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.SwUiVavHKMWG7t5K","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"O7OCMTl2lIUesaOC"},{"type":"action","name":"Aura of Noon and Midnight","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p>30 feet. The shadowblooded emits an aura that controls the light level around them. They can choose between bright light, dim light, or darkness. When they choose bright light, all creatures in the aura's light are @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TkIyaNPgTZFBCCuh]{Dazzled}. When they choose darkness, even creatures with darkvision (but not greater darkvision) treat targets seen through the aura's darkness as @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.DmAIPqOBomZ7H95W]{Concealed}. The shadowblooded can change the nature of their aura by spending an action with the concentrate trait.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[{"alwaysActive":true,"key":"RollOption","option":"aura-of-noon-and-midnight","suboptions":[{"label":"BZES.SpecificRule.Shadowblooded.Lighting.BrightLight","value":"bright"},{"label":"BZES.SpecificRule.Shadowblooded.Lighting.Darkness","value":"darkness"},{"label":"BZES.SpecificRule.Shadowblooded.Lighting.DimLight","value":"dim"}],"toggleable":true,"value":true,"selection":"dim"},{"key":"Aura","radius":30,"traits":["darkness","divine","light","shadow"],"effects":[{"uuid":"Compendium.battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e.effects.Item.dDif4DJUw80RHR7P","includesSelf":false,"predicate":["aura-of-noon-and-midnight:bright"]}]},{"key":"TokenLight","predicate":["aura-of-noon-and-midnight:bright"],"value":{"alpha":0.1,"animation":{"intensity":1,"speed":1,"type":"sunburst"},"attenuation":0.4,"bright":30,"color":"#bcb4a9","dim":0,"shadows":0.2,"luminosity":0.1}},{"key":"TokenLight","predicate":["aura-of-noon-and-midnight:dim"],"value":{"alpha":0.1,"animation":{"intensity":1,"speed":1},"attenuation":0.4,"bright":0,"color":"#bcb4a9","dim":30,"shadows":0.2,"luminosity":0.1}}],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["aura","darkness","divine","light","shadow"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"interaction","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"zHPxc3OAXBqP4MJS","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Dualistic Nature","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p>The body of a shadowblooded interacts in unusual ways with both vitality and void energy, shifting instantaneously depending upon the lighting conditions. In bright light, the shadowblooded is immune to vitality damage and can be healed by effects with the vitality trait. In darkness, the shadowblooded is immune to void damage and is healed by effects with the void trait. In dim light, the shadowblooded is immune to both vitality and void damage but can't be healed by effects with either the vitality or void trait.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[{"key":"ActiveEffectLike","mode":"override","path":"system.attributes.hp.negativeHealing","value":true,"predicate":["aura-of-noon-and-midnight:darkness"]},{"key":"Immunity","type":["vitality","void"],"predicate":["aura-of-noon-and-midnight:dim"]}],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"MMve3x31nUGcUAh0","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Spectral Strike","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p>All of the shadowblooded's strikes have the benefits of the <em>ghost touch</em> property rune.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[{"key":"AdjustStrike","mode":"add","property":"property-runes","value":"ghost-touch"}],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"Ylb33Bk0JZBFd0Ym","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Shadowlight","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p>The damage type that the shadowblooded's Strikes deal depends upon the lighting conditions: fire damage in bright light, cold damage in darkness, and half fire damage half cold damage in dim light.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[{"key":"DamageAlteration","mode":"override","predicate":["aura-of-noon-and-midnight:darkness","dice:damage:type:fire"],"property":"damage-type","selectors":["strike-damage"],"value":"cold"},{"key":"DamageAlteration","mode":"override","predicate":["aura-of-noon-and-midnight:bright","dice:damage:type:cold"],"property":"damage-type","selectors":["strike-damage"],"value":"fire"}],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"mJCmtMCtwLgA9Ymt","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Dualistic Vampirism","system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"description":{"value":"<p>The shadowblooded reaches draws in vitality energy, void energy, or both, affecting different creatures depending on the lighting conditions. All affected creatures within 60 feet take @Damage[16d6[untyped]] damage (@Check[fortitude|dc:42|basic]). In bright light, creatures with void healing are affected, and the effect deals vitality damage. In darkness, living creatures are affected, and the effect deals void damage. In dim light, both living creatures and creatures with void healing are affected, with each taking whichever of vitality or void damage is worse for them. The shadowblooded then gains a number of temporary Hit Points equal to the amount of damage taken by the creature that took the most damage from this effect (or half this number of temporary Hit Points in dim light). The shadowblooded can't use Dualistic Vampirism for [[/gmr 1d4 #rounds]]{1d4 rounds}.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["divine","manipulate","vitality","void"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":2},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"suIWdckPLrVjRkli","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Shadow Jump","system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"description":{"value":"<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The shadowblooded is in an area of dim light</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The shadowblooded steps into a shadow, reappearing out of another shadow that they can see within 300 feet. If they end this movement adjacent to a creature, they can make a melee Strike against that creature. The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{Off-Guard} against this attack.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate